{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_title", "source_sha256": "2255df3ba7dcd2409e2ded83a09469ff3ed3102f7f3d479c53fc91e0254db342", "ja": "プロジェクト茜ちゃん～グッズ倍増計画～", "zh": "小茜专案～周边商品倍增计划～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25f579e89dcf3a4154ee2eb651e4ae8f3d67ed0bc7f3583c71873f98dbd465fa", "ja": "茜のやる気は、公演のレッスンではなく\n茜ちゃんグッズ販売に向けられていた。\nプロデューサーにプレッシャーからの逃避を\n見抜かれた茜は、仲間達を前にいよいよ\n覚悟を決め、地獄のレッスンへと向かう！", "zh": "茜的干劲没有用在公演的练习，\n而是放在如何贩售小茜周边商品上。\n被制作人看出是想要逃避压力后，\n茜终于在伙伴面前下定决心，\n准备进行地狱训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3e864b9fd02c644683e2b57cb722f10a4993a7e396132dcf52cd717ba24b995", "ja": "（茜のセンター公演は、無事終わった！\n幕をおろした後も、歓声が劇場に鳴り響いている……）", "zh": "（茜的Center公演顺利结束了！\n闭幕之后，如雷贯耳的欢呼声依旧响彻剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a159a98a4a52027c538ea58f038fb6f63fdcddaff4f450cf91ade653194bac37", "ja": "お疲れさま、茜！\n初センター公演、どうだった？", "zh": "辛苦你了，茜！\n第一次的Center公演，感想如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "651ffd55c416e662ec276fc528da6dd7e8ef0b5a2bb9727380afd9b4b7afae02", "ja": "はぁ…はぁ…お疲れ、{$P$}ちゃん…\n茜ちゃん、真っ白に燃え尽きたよ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……辛苦了，小{$P$}……\n小茜已经燃烧殆尽、全身苍白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "996784a083b3afaf134d6aa7fad61a6c7772e7a69a1d0b95e0ba26bcd830f1fc", "ja": "聞こえる？　ファンのみんなの、この歓声……！\n茜ちゃんのステージは最高だったと、称える声が……！", "zh": "你听到了吗？粉丝们的欢呼声……！\n大家对小茜的表演赞不绝口的声音……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6b3c65752bedad0e5f808afaaa39d75cb47bb45ed6eb27ad09121e66e6640a34", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nファンのみんなも、満足してくれたと思う！", "zh": "嗯，我听到了。\n我想粉丝们肯定也感到很满意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "21187139525080488f5e8113dfdb5c0313a7443cb6f1f1b88c2e5d2d065ab206", "ja": "はぁ……茜ちゃん、もう思い残すことはないよ……。\nこれで……安心して……ガクッ。", "zh": "呼……小茜已经没有任何遗憾了……\n这样就能……安心地……（倒地）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "ba83cf3287b8e39a288a9565fadf7e4a3fc0f9efc2b852128e64111044dfd91b", "ja": "あれっ？　茜ちゃん、元気ないの？　元気出して！\nはいっ、こちょこちょこちょこちょ～♪", "zh": "咦？小茜，你累了吗？打起精神来！\n看我的！搔痒搔痒搔痒搔痒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "4244d1a22a68aed703177a8358b0e5535c9c73fe4376a316fff262579ff5c352", "ja": "ニャハハハハ！　や、やめて麗花ちゃん！\n笑うと痛い！　筋肉痛が痛いから～！！", "zh": "喵哈哈哈哈！住、住手啊小丽花！\n笑起来会痛啊！肌肉酸痛啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "6156bc5423e2861366563f1092100989c8fa2ae9ee2ba7d93e63c86f180753be", "ja": "お疲れさま、茜。やるじゃない！\n間違いなく、最高のステージだったわよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，茜。表现不错嘛！\n这肯定是最棒的演出喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "1f258386547390db921649de94d59aa016c18c4fa6497bec329cf6284885ee9e", "ja": "ニャハハハハ！　そうでしょうそうでしょう！\n茜ちゃんがちょっと本気を出せば、これくらい……。", "zh": "喵哈哈哈哈！是不是！\n小茜只要认真起来，根本不算什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fab6d4fb513d6cc30d17230552b262206f5263eb80b9e3b606c27d04e97dd542", "ja": "待て待て。グッズに逃げてた茜が実力を出せたのは、\n誰のお陰だ？", "zh": "等一下等一下。茜，你本来还想利用周边商品逃避，\n是谁帮助你发挥出实力的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed1b93afdc945f8b914d7cad974d38160ad73761d1e34a1efa3a9973f1799c1f", "ja": "そ、それを言われると……ぐぬぬ。\nそれもこれも、律子さんの地獄の特訓のおかげ……。", "zh": "这、这么说来……呜呜呜。\n这都要感谢律子姊的地狱特训……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "c81ab69a88d4c22acbe6115db8bbaf4b25cdaa4ea20e7df169e5f8801e299479", "ja": "そうね、私に感謝しなさい。……って言いたい\nところだけど、それは茜が特訓を乗り切ったからよ。", "zh": "没错，好好感谢我吧……我本来是想这么说啦，\n但你自己也撑过了特训，才能有今天的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1013_p", "source_sha256": "63e8dcd2cb3d1382430119f5696b83c9e073b879ba4ddf377d6476a7a1564e7d", "ja": "そうだな。律子も、レッスンが辛いと\n逃げ出そうとしてたものな。", "zh": "是啊，就连律子遇到辛苦的训练时，\n也曾经想逃避呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "6878f80f61fd0530e23bce69905e923152849d9515649bc167ebe3eb9994ec97", "ja": "そ、それは言わない約束ですよ、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "说、说好不提这件事的，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "3f54b1e39c14a2c5af6d546456321c3b8735315ab3f216cd4ed0d343ee372570", "ja": "とにかく、本当によく頑張ったわね。\n今回ばかりは、褒めてあげるわ！", "zh": "总之，你真的很努力了。\n这次我就夸奖你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "0e6aad616916eb03924ff1f283a9eab546e5d1b0fec5fdfefe400af220fdfade", "ja": "うう、律子さん……。", "zh": "呜呜，律子姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "c0fedb5faa33564df1779628dc4fc85b854eb829d47f072fe49775e488e35edc", "ja": "……でも、なんだかちょっと意外でした。茜さんでも、\n自分のことだと余裕がなくなったりするんですね", "zh": "……不过，我觉得有点意外。\n就算是茜，轮到自己担纲时，也会觉得紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "3b90a20465f0f58c115567bb589841ecee2be89771f8410329297b0388c216e6", "ja": "ふふ、そうですね～。自分自身が、\n一番見えにくいものなのかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "呵呵，对啊～\n自己的事或许最看不清呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3ea9ca7d6a76c8a40f37a124b575cf406c92012f597a1d0f04a3e82bc167b132", "ja": "そうだな。でもきっと、そういう時のために\n仲間がいるんだ。それから、プロデューサーも。", "zh": "是啊，不过也因为这样，\n才会需要伙伴，还有制作人的协助吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "188d2c1906a582e20d8a37a74bfb12ddfa0faab9243de1ca9351d031dcafbc1a", "ja": "うふふ。ちょっと生意気ですけど……\nでも、そうかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "呵呵，虽然有点自以为是……\n不过，或许真是如此呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "38b601d1b480c0a8091f54839c78428da8c5c065f922167c46285e8640b28e83", "ja": "みんな、それに{$P$}ちゃんも、\nありがとー！", "zh": "大家、小{$P$}，\n谢谢你们──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "f8fbcd93c8db85ec7331189a7bd377a8857a298f349cf34d1aab3861f424b7b7", "ja": "うふふ、どういたしまして～。また愛のムチが\n必要になったら、いつでも言ってくださいね～。", "zh": "呵呵，不客气～以后如果还需要爱的教育，\n随时都能跟我说喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e5965683658f5fce1f68e8ccc4c4db3ae8a3277a32ba0de7c14a28abb99c9bc7", "ja": "そうだな。そのときは、俺からもお願いするよ。", "zh": "是啊，到时候我也会请大家再帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "a700de5b956759b9218847d09bc4c297b9a1aa9d1043a1603ebdb263d71338d5", "ja": "そ、それはもうカンベンして～っ！", "zh": "这、这个就饶了小茜吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "981e7463ff0d36e82de7692549ef08a8f1087f826d96e8204c8cdc197487422d", "ja": "あの、そろそろ控え室に戻りませんか。ここだと\n片付けのジャマですし、向こうの方が休めます。", "zh": "那个，是不是该回准备室了呢？\n一直待在后台会妨碍大家清场，我们回去休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "9301a96797af99af98ec1c433073a4c55737ecc785471c292ee5e0f519fe95d0", "ja": "う～ん、そうだね～。\nしかし茜ちゃんは、もう一歩も動けない……。", "zh": "唔～说得也是～\n可是小茜已经累到走不动了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "16c6cdfbd70ce8f157738da481c705badcad2544761f15c86f975cad028b30e7", "ja": "あら……これは、重症のようですね～。\nとっておきのご褒美が、必要そうですよ～？", "zh": "哎呀……看来情况很严重呢～\n好像需要特别的奖励喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1029_p", "source_sha256": "42a729e78576120d16cc5bd93e1ba810f922bb65fbc4e0679ada536e0371f7df", "ja": "とっておきのご褒美？", "zh": "特别的奖励？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "2fcfbc8f8e7eb921047eeec8b2abb3208495b76c2f4692c2f9c9fe5fab161feb", "ja": "それはもちろん、ナデナデなのだー！\nさぁみんな！　思う存分、茜ちゃんをなでるといいよ！", "zh": "那当然就是摸摸头啊──！\n来吧大家！尽情摸摸小茜的头吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "7ce01643a74bd130a5f606058e6e3bdf85a3eda746304171347b32cd5ba38d12", "ja": "そうですね～。でも……。", "zh": "没错呢～不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed33cd298f71486dc9610c3f4fca300c1f8c57bd5581c5e6302c498b56ec4863", "ja": "はい。私も、思いっきりナデナデしてあげたいけど、\n今日は{$P$}さんに譲ります♪", "zh": "对啊，虽然我也很想尽情摸摸头，\n但今天还是让给{$P$}先生摸吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1033_p", "source_sha256": "fed091f068e55cee7bbb4a24aa5b9215ee2982dd657532f53e180f595348af85", "ja": "え、俺に？", "zh": "咦，我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_026_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "930c2f72a5030a6b93fe0fe22f21525a49edf129eba888742631f12181c7346c", "ja": "そうです！　さあ、目いっぱいナデナデして、\n茜ちゃんにエネルギーを充電しちゃってください♪", "zh": "没错！来，尽情地摸摸头，\n为小茜充电吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
